WEBVTT

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:42.000
I've never experienced an all-you-can-eat shishi meat buffet.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.980
It's so heavy.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.420
There are mountains of large gold nuggets!

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.300
Hey, both of you!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.900
How much longer are you going to sleep?

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.620
It's way past wake-up time.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.080
Right away!

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:13.800
Are you two okay?

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.860
Yeah, somehow...

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:29.330
The Two Go Out Shopping

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.830
Good morning, everyone!

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:39.010
Today's breakfast includes a pot full of vegetable soup, smoked meat, and pako.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.580
Here you go.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.420
Here you go.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:55.190
"Munch munch?"

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.150
Ah!  You're snacking!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.700
Those big cheeks are the proof!

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.480
Mokku!  Are you all right, Mokku?!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.490
We're repenting.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:21.340
We're very sorry!

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:26.070
You two combined can't even do half the amount of work.

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:32.360
Oh, no.  We might be able to do only half the average labor, but I can easily eat about three people's worth.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.650
I can eat five people's worth.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.960
At this rate, I'll have to fire you.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:42.990
Asking you guys to do stuff increases my own work!

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.770
Please!  Anything but that!

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.270
We beg you!

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:49.960
Still...

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:57.270
If we get serious, we can do one or two, in fact, ten or twenty jobs in a matter of minutes.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.250
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:04.450
If you say so, then go into town and do some shopping.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.520
"Shopping?"

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:08.340
Something that easy?

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:09.890
Easy-peasy.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:13.190
The money's in that bag.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:20.060
Five small gold nuggets is a huge amount.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.100
Don't you dare lose it!

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.280
All right!  Leave it to us!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:34.820
Nukku, Nukku, Nukku, the great hot guy.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:40.070
Mokku, take your hat off for a moment.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:51.030
Listen, Mokku, it's a large amount of money, so don't drop it.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:02.370
Listen, we'll succeed at this <i>shopping</i> no matter what!

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:07.610
And, we'll show that Karisa what we can do.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.750
Got it, Mokku?

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:10.930
What?

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:13.520
Mokku?

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:16.330
Come on over, come on over!

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:20.280
Have some freshly steamed buns!

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:21.030
There you go.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:24.900
Hey, Mokku!  Stop wasting time!

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:28.390
The buns here look very delicious!

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.700
We're not here to buy you snacks!

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.040
We need to finish this quickly and get back.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.850
Hey, Mokku.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.400
What's with this old man?

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:50.700
I'm sorry... but could you take me to a doctor?

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:55.210
My stomach hurts so much...  I'm about to die.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.190
Old man!

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.670
What do we do?

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.880
We have no choice but to take him to a doctor.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:06.750
We didn't come all the way here from Kazalm to do this, damn it!

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.050
Wait for me, Ani-

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.550
Wait for me, Ani!

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:15.490
Wait for me!

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:30.250
We handed him over to the doctor, so he should be fine now.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:33.050
It's all good now.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.940
I ran so much, I'm really hot now.

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:38.430
Hey, Mokku.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.990
What did you do with the bag?

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:41.250
"Bag?"

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:47.700
You want to eat the buns, too, now?

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:51.180
No.  I'm talking about the bag with the money inside.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.680
I put it under your hat, remember?

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:55.280
"Money?"

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:02.230
<i>Listen, Mokku, it's a large amount of money, so don't drop it.</i>

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.200
I remember now!

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.990
The money's right here.

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:19.920
Why would you find it in a place like that?!

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:23.160
I bet you dropped it somewhere.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.780
Let's go find it!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.300
Where is it?

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.860
Where is it, where is it?!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.410
Where the heck is it?

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:38.870
Where is it?!  Where is it?!

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.130
Money...  Money...

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.040
Ani!  Ani!

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:45.800
I found it!  It's the bag!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:46.790
What?!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.890
It's inside here.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.620
Hey, that's not our bag.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.830
I guess it wasn't.

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:00.080
You guys got a problem?

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:04.290
Do you need something?

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:10.530
Excuse us!

00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:17.470
Money...  Money...

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.360
Bag...  Bag...

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:32.610
It's not here!  It's not here!  It's not here!  It's not here!

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.780
Couldn't even find it here.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.270
You guys...

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.530
We're sorry!

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:02.940
We've been searching so much, yet we haven't been able to find it.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:08.540
Maybe someone already picked it up and used it.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.000
What should we do?

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.610
Where did those two go?

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:29.940
Karisa-san said they went into town to go shopping.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:33.530
Then, shouldn't they be back by now?

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.790
Yeah...

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.770
I'm going to go check on them.

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:51.030
All right!  We should go make some money!

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:53.010
How do we do that?

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:57.320
That is the biggest problem.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.490
What's that noise?

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:05.440
A show, eh?

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:08.450
Everyone gathered here, hello!

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.670
There's no trick involved here.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:15.840
I shall make this man here disappear.

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:18.550
Ready?

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:21.940
One, two, three.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:23.420
Away!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.190
T-That's amazing!

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.610
A person disappeared!

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:32.940
Thank you very much.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.050
All right!  This is it!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.780
Our turn to do it!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:53.070
Don't come any closer.  Don't come any closer.

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.380
I have no hidden trick.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:59.980
I will make this man disappear.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.840
I don't want to disappear!

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:10.150
What's wrong?  Hurry up and make him disappear!

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:14.070
Hide in the bushes behind us.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:18.710
All right, ready?

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:21.340
One, two, three!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.460
You idiot!  Your hips aren't hidden!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.590
That was stupid.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:36.260
Let's go home.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:40.540
Everyone went home because of you!

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.970
But I thought it went well!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.860
You totally had your butt sticking out!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:47.890
Stupid!  Idiot!  Doofus!

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:50.230
I am not a doofus!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.580
Nice one!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:21.860
Awesome!

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.050
Thank you, thank you.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:33.510
It's far from being five small gold nuggets.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:40.860
If only there were some jobs with good offers out there.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.940
Hey, you guys.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:54.900
I-It's him.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:57.160
We're sorry.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.910
You're looking for a job with a good offer?

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:05.010
Then can you help me out a bit?

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:08.320
There's a job with a real good offer.

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:11.480
"A job with a good offer?!"

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:21.400
I want you to pluck out all the weeds in this field.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.140
"A-All?"

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:25.560
T-That's impossible.

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:28.270
I'll pay you plenty.

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:29.610
Pay?!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:35.570
By that, do you mean with shiny golden things?

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:39.090
Yeah, plenty of shiny golden things.

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:42.740
All right!  Leave it to us!

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:46.050
Let's do this!

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:07.720
I'm tired.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.180
I can't go on anymore.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:12.880
Me, neither.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:23.610
Ani, let's go home.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.070
We don't have the money.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:30.010
There's no way we can go back like this.

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:36.840
Do we want to go back to traveling and return to being petty thieves?

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:42.840
We've done nothing except run away our whole lives.

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:44.250
<i>Hey!</i>

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:50.720
Running away from service because the officer was scary.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.130
Running away from work because we were tired.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:04.890
It's the same this time, too.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:09.180
We can't!

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:14.280
Ani, we quit running away after meeting Erin-chan!

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:20.520
We promised to work hard like Erin-chan!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:27.780
<i>Stop! </i>

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:32.770
<i>Please don't hurt my friends with the same hands that can play such a gentle song. </i>

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:37.830
<i>What happened to you two?!</i>

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:43.150
<i>"Cure...  poison, poison..."</i>

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.650
<i>It hurts!</i>

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.590
<i>They begged to stay, even if they were to work without pay. </i>

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:52.270
<i>They're going to stay and help the dorm parent.</i>

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:54.590
<i>We're not gonna leave you! </i>

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:55.930
<i>We'll always be together!</i>

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.420
You're right, Mokku!

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.780
Okay!  Let's finish this!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:08.850
We will!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.380
All right! I'm gonna work hard!

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:14.850
Ready?

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.190
Wow.

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:23.080
All right, me too.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:17:00.220
It's done...

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:06.120
Wow, you've done well.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:09.130
Here's what I promised.

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:14.690
I've been waiting for this!

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:20.850
Open sesame.

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.260
What the heck is this?

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:26.120
They're potatoes!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:30.980
They've got a great golden tint, and don't they look good?

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:49.950
No matter what we do, we're always failures.

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:55.710
Now we can't face Erin-chan.

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:12.170
Erin-chan...

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:16.230
Nukku-san.  Mokku-san.

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:18.110
I've always liked you two.

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.820
Goodbye.

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:38.210
Erin-chan!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.450
Don't cry, Mokku!

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:45.250
A man should never show tears, no matter what!

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.840
I said...

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.270
don't cry!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:55.180
Erin-chan!  I really liked you, too!

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:56.710
Me, too!

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.750
I really, really liked her, too!

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:02.840
I really, really, really liked her, too!

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:07.520
I really, really, really, really liked her, too!

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:11.460
I'm going back to where Erin-chan is.

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:13.630
Hold on, Mokku!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.090
I said wait!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.670
Wait for me, Mokku.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.380
Nukku-san.  Mokku-san.

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:38.860
Little girl.

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:44.100
I was worried since you were so late getting back.

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:53.070
I'm glad you're safe.

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:08.500
You're the old man with the stomachache.

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:19.670
You used to teach here, eh?

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:23.940
I wanted to say a word of thanks and came here.

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:28.680
It could have been dangerous if you two hadn't helped me.

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.430
Thank you very much.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:33.050
It was nothing.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:34.920
You embarrass us.

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:39.940
By the way, the money I gave you for shopping...

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:49.210
You see... the money you gave us... we...

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.910
You mean this money?

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:57.630
You two took something else.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:04.840
That bag had some snacks in it.

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:10.190
Seriously, how careless can you two be?

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:12.970
Mokku.

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:14.330
Ani!

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:17.180
We're so glad!

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:17.630
That's great!

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.080
We're so glad!
That's great!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:18.800
We're so glad!

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:20.250
That's great!

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:23.210
That's so great.

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:34.670
Just like that, Kazalm campus begins another typical morning.

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:39.830
And just what happened with those two?

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:44.300
How much longer are you going to sleep?

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:46.670
It's way past wake-up-

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:50.680
What?  Where did they go?

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:53.150
We're right here.

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:55.770
We're changing our mentality.

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:58.590
We'll work hard.

00:21:59.030 --> 00:22:02.150
That's wonderful.

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:05.890
Nukku-san!  Mokku-san!

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:07.470
Good morning!

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:08.570
It's the little girl!

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:09.780
It's Erin-chan!

00:22:09.780 --> 00:22:12.450
Good morning!

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:19.380
Are you two all right?!

00:22:21.160 --> 00:22:22.820
Yeah.  We're fine.

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:04.670
Summer vacation at Kazalm is about to begin.

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:09.020
I get a warning from Esal-sensei regarding my studies.

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:15.620
If I don't pass the summer trial which determines if you advance or not, I'll have to leave Kazalm.

00:24:16.130 --> 00:24:20.180
Lilan.  I'll study hard so I don't fail!

00:24:21.050 --> 00:24:23.970
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Lilan's Heart.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:30.070
Lilan's Heart
